# The plugin for Epic Online Services (Android) writes the keys of the product here. They belong to whoever builds the app and
# are not for a public repository.
/Assets/StreamingAssets/EOS/
/Assets/StreamingAssets/EOS.meta

# The same plugin fills these in at every Android build: a copy of its library module (with a scheme derived from the client id) and
# the AAR files of the SDK. They are made again from the package each time, so they do not belong in the repository.
/Assets/Plugins/Android/EOS/
/Assets/Plugins/Android/EOS.meta
/Assets/Plugins/Android/aar/
/Assets/Plugins/Android/aar.meta
Build_Android/
